> H2 stores users and API-specific rate limits.
> ConcurrentHashMap stores the in-memory Bucket4j buckets.
> No JWT/Auth yet.
> We identify the user using userKey from a request header. (UserKeyAuthenticationFilter)
> User types: ADMIN, NORMAL, GUEST.
> APIs: login, history (Filter level) and getUsers (Method Level).
> Each user can have a different rate limit for each API.

